        <rdfs:label>Organ part cluster</rdfs:label>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Anatomical cluster which consists of all or some members of one or more organ part subclasses which are grouped together according to some shared attributes. Examples: root of lung, internal nose, soft palate, wall of gut, periorbita.</obo:IAO_0000115>
